   33,
   "m43rrgjd38g.2378",
   "You wrote that the AI works on \"ML probability.\" Whatever runs under the hood, the useful numbers are these: Legendary is set to 90% on attacking intelligence, defending intelligence, reaction speed and marking."
  ],
  [
   28,
   "m43rrgjd38g.5516",
   "FC 26 has no such instruction, but since update 1.2.0 its AI defenders mark the edge of the box less tightly, so look back for the late man."
  ],
  [
   28,
   "m43rrgjd38g.5219",
   "In PC Gamer's testing across dozens of FIFA 23 matches, headers from crosses almost never scored, corners rarely threatened, and goals from beyond about 20 yards were uncommon."
  ],
  [
   27,
   "m43rrgjd38g.12099",
   "The CM can't turn with a defender on his back, so he lays it off first-time to the pivot, who faces forward and plays the winger in."
  ],
  [
   26,
   "m43rrgjd38g.12758",
   "What it has said: since update 1.4.0 (January 2026) the Squad Battles AI moves the ball forward quicker, and its defenders react slower while they turn."
  ]
